{"_comment":"EXAMPLE ONLY. Copy to lifecycle-config.json and fill in your tenant values. Never commit the real file.","changeTicketPattern":"^CHG-[0-9]+$","domain":"contoso.com","maxTenantUsers":1000,"notes":"usageLocation must be a valid ISO 3166-1 alpha-2 code; it is required before license assignment. maxTenantUsers is the tenant-size boundary (default 1000): this tool is sized for small and mid-size businesses and Review-AccessReview fails closed above it rather than returning incomplete results from unpaged Graph queries. Raise it only if your tenant is legitimately larger. changeTicketPattern is OPTIONAL: omit it (or set it to an empty string) and any non-empty -ChangeTicket satisfies the ticket gates (presence check only; approval is process control, not code control). Set it to a regex and the ticket must match, or the gated operation fails closed. An invalid regex fails config validation at load time.","tenantId":"00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000","upnPattern":"{first}.{last}","usageLocation":"US"}